    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273976</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>サンキューブルーベリー☆</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thank you berry much~ ☆</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273980</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほくほくほく♪
今日は何を買おうかな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>La-di-daaa~ ♪ What
should I buy today?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273980</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>グミ、ボトル、食材……
手持ちの５億ガルドで
何買おう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Gels, bottles, food... I have
500,000,000 Gald on me,
but what to spend it on...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273984</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よ、よし！
アップルグミを買うぞ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A-Alright! I'll
buy an apple gel!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273984</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>で、でも、手持ちのお金で
足りるかな……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>B-But, do I have
enough money...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273988</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>は、初めての買い物なんだ……
えっと……何、買おっかな……
よしっ……き、決めた……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is my f-first time shopping...
Ohhh... What...should I buy...?
Alright, l-let's go with this...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273988</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>み、見ないでよ、
緊張して買えないだろ……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>H-Hey, don't stare at me. I'll be
too nervous to buy anything...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273992</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え、えっと……
ラ、ラ、ライ……
……ララライクボッ……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>U-Um...  I'd l-like
one l-l...l-l-live bot...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273992</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……じゃなくて、
ライフ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait, it's not a "live"
bottle... It's "life"...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273992</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……だ、だめだ……
は、はずかしい……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I-I can't do this... 
I-It's too embarrassing...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ママにもらった５億ガルド、
どうやって使おうかな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mama gave me 500,000,000 Gald,
but how am I going to spend it...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ママには全部使いきってこいって
言われたけど、できるかな、
ドキドキ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She told me to come back after I
spend all of it, but can I? I don't
know how... And I'm so...n-nervous...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274000</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、あのっ！
レモングミひとつ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>E-Excuse me! 
One lemon gel!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274000</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……え？　あれ？
き、きみ、店員さんじゃ
ないの……？　なんだよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Huh? Eh? Y-you're
not a clerk here...?
Oh, come on...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
