      <PointerOffset>274016</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よぃーす、
こんな時だけど
一応営業中よ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heyo. Yeah, it's
not a great time,
but we are still open.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
