    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274036</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さんくすですよぅ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thank.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>世界が大変なのにこんなところで、
暢気に買い物してんなよ
とかって思ってるでしょ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm sure you're thinking, "How could
she be out shopping so casually right
now, of all times? Doesn't she know...?"</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あんたも同じよっ！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, right back at you!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274044</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>人は生きてりゃ
腹が減るのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Long as you're alive, 
you'll get hungry.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274044</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>世界の危機も心配だけど、
腹が減る心配を忘れる
わけにゃいかんでしょーが</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm concerned about the state of the world,
of course, but I can't just *forget* to be
concerned about my empty stomach, can I?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274048</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まったく、世界の危機だの
英雄だの、スペクタクルだの、
そんなんじゃ腹は膨れないつーの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sheesh. "The state of the world" this,
"heroes" that. It's all one big spectacle,
and spectacles don't fill your stomach.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274048</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私が欲しいのは今日の晩御飯の
レシピなのよ、きれいに衣服の
汚れが落ちる洗剤なのよっっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>All I want is a recipe for tonight's
dinner, and a detergent to clean
the stains from my clothes!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274052</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あんたらがのうのうと旅
できんのは、誰のおかげだか
知ってるの！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're out frolicking on your little journey,
but do you ever stop and think whose
hard work makes all that possible?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274052</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>影で武器やら道具やらを
揃えてくれる人がいるからよっ！
覚えておきなさい！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's because of all the people behind the
scenes supplying your weapons, your armor,
your items! And don't you forget it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>邪魔邪魔！
ちょっとあんた、
主人公気取り！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Excuse *you*!
Talk about main
character syndrome!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私の物語では私が主人公なのよっ！
わかってるの！　あんたなんて
脇役なんだからねっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In my story, *I'm* the main
character! You got that!? The
two of you are just NPCs!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274060</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あんたらなんか私にしてみりゃ
「クソ生意気なガキ」と
「少しだけカワイイ娘」よ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>From my point of view,
you're "Bratty Little Punk"
and "Somewhat Cute-ish Girl."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274060</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんのことかわかんない！？
この私が、いちいち説明なんて
すると思う！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You still don't get it, do ya!?
You think I'm gonna spell every
little thing out for ya, don't ya!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
